#: home/.local/bin/sway-desktop-config
msgid ""
"usage: sway-desktop-config get <key>   shows a value, for the Bash scripts\n"
"       sway-desktop-config generate      writes the files that depend on the color\n"
"       sway-desktop-config apply         writes the files and reloads Sway\n"
"       sway-desktop-config css           shows the accent colors as GTK CSS (@define-color)\n"
"       sway-desktop-config enabled NAME  exits 0 if the component is on in [enabled], 1 if not\n"
"       sway-desktop-config waybar [FILE] writes the Waybar config without the modules turned off\n"
"       sway-desktop-config keys          writes config.d/00-keys.conf, the includes of the shortcut profile"
msgstr ""
"uso: sway-desktop-config get <chave>   mostra um valor, para os scripts em Bash\n"
"     sway-desktop-config generate      grava os arquivos que dependem da cor\n"
"     sway-desktop-config apply         grava os arquivos e recarrega o Sway\n"
"     sway-desktop-config css           mostra as cores do destaque em CSS do GTK (@define-color)\n"
"     sway-desktop-config enabled NOME  sai com 0 se o componente está ligado no [enabled], 1 se não\n"
"     sway-desktop-config waybar [ARQ]  grava o config da Waybar sem os módulos desligados\n"
"     sway-desktop-config keys          grava o config.d/00-keys.conf, os include do perfil de atalhos"

#: home/.local/bin/sway-desktop-config
msgid ""
"The popups already open with the new color. The rest changes when you log in again or restart it:\n"
"  Waybar: ~/.local/bin/sway-waybar restart\n"
"  drawer: pkill -x sway-drawer; ~/.local/bin/sway-drawer start\n"
"  volume and brightness indicator: pkill -x sway-osd-bar (it opens again by itself)\n"
"  dock and notifications: when you log in again"
msgstr ""
"Os popups já abrem com a cor nova. O resto muda ao entrar de novo na sessão ou ao reiniciar:\n"
"  Waybar: ~/.local/bin/sway-waybar restart\n"
"  gaveta: pkill -x sway-drawer; ~/.local/bin/sway-drawer start\n"
"  indicador de volume e brilho: pkill -x sway-osd-bar (ele abre de novo sozinho)\n"
"  dock e notificações: ao entrar de novo na sessão"

